    ],
  },
  en: {
    eyebrow: "Official 2026 permits",
    title: "Inca Trail Availability 2026",
    intro:
      "The Inca Trail is one of the world's most iconic trekking routes, combining natural beauty, Inca archaeology and a unique cultural experience. High demand and strict regulations make availability essential when planning this journey.",
